  "instructions": [
    {
      "step": 1,
      "text": "Combine the ginger, chillies, sesame oil, fish sauce, and coconut in a blender or food processor; process until evenly combined."
    },
    {
      "step": 2,
      "text": "Use the marinade with the intended protein. Cook poultry to 165°F; ground meat to 160°F; whole cuts of beef, pork, veal, lamb, or goat to 145°F followed by a 3-minute rest; or fish to 145°F or until opaque and easily flaked."
    }
